{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1060967/block/singleImage/3252296/wm/01KR2YNHWTAF3N8ERNNJCVQQQT.jpeg?updatedAt=1793259890\"/><figcaption>赤柱豪宅約1000萬美元珠寶失竊，不排除外傭涉案。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (29 日 ) 下午 1 時許，警方接獲赤柱舂磡角道42號紫荊園一單位戶主報案，指自己從海外回來後，發現兩件總值 1,000 萬美元、即大約 7,800 萬港元的珠寶不翼而飛。 警方接報到場調查，案件列「盜竊」跟進，暫未有人被捕。據了解，不排除事件與其外傭有關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:03.615254+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:43:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:38:07.773049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:22.925963+00:00","content_hash":"3ef5c1c641289a36b6d1f6ce0134e97a537730bcc7f922e46dae622ee47508dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:42:03.615254+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}